11
01:01:28,235 --> 01:01:34,235
The Assignment (also known as Tomboy, Revenger (in Australia) and formerly known as (Re) Assignment and Tomboy: A
Revenger's Tale) is an action crime thriller film directed by Walter Hill and co-written by Hill and Denis Hamill.

12
01:07:03,529 --> 01:07:09,529
The film stars Michelle Rodriguez, Tony Shalhoub, Anthony
LaPaglia, Caitlin Gerard, and Sigourney Weaver.

13
01:12:38,823 --> 01:12:44,823
The film had its world premiere at the Toronto
International Film Festival on September 11, 2016.

14
01:18:14,117 --> 01:18:20,117
It was released on March 3, 2017, through video on demand, prior to
a limited release on April 7, 2017, by Saban Films.

15
01:23:49,411 --> 01:23:55,411
The film explores themes of assassin, gangster,
sex change, revenge, mad surgeon.

